<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala sets div on convertible preferred shr.</title>
<headline>Ayala sets div on convertible preferred shr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Corporation said on Tuesday it had set a 12.5 centavo cash dividend to holders of its convertible preferred B shares as of April 22.</p>
<p>The dividend, given for the fourth quarter of 1996, is payable on April 30.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
